.Dd November 19, 2026
.Dt DERFETCH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm derfetch
.Nd show system information next to Genesis the tortoise
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl lnV
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the DER/32 mascot, Genesis the tortoise, beside a summary of the
running system: the DER/32 release from the
.Va kern.der32
sysctl tree, the NetBSD base release, the kernel configuration and build,
uptime, the number of packages installed by
.Xr upkg 8 ,
shell, terminal, CPU, memory and root filesystem usage.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl l
Do not print the logo.
.It Fl n
Do not use color.
Color is also off when standard output is not a terminal or
.Ev NO_COLOR
is set.
.It Fl V
Print the version and exit.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width NO_COLOR
.It Ev NO_COLOR
Disable color.
.It Ev UPKG_ROOT
Count packages in the upkg database and the pkgsrc database
.Pq Pa /usr/pkg/pkgdb
below this root.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/lib/upkg/upkg.db -compact
.It Pa /var/lib/upkg/upkg.db
installed package database, read-only
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr uname 1 ,
.Xr sysctl 7 ,
.Xr upkg 8
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
first appeared in DER/32 0.1
.Dq Genesis .
